 nāhan· kvaiḥni<span class="space" tip="Space left blank in a line because (part of) another character hanging down from the previous line encroaches on the current line" lang="kaw kawi">⊔</span>kanaṁ rāma manarima mā<span tip="Hyphen break" lang="zxx latin">-</span></line><line lang="kaw kawi"><nline break="false" phantom="false" significant="true"><span tip="Line start" lang="zxx latin">⟨1r8⟩</span><!--space--> </nline><ncell break="false" phantom="true" significant="true"/>s·, paknānikanaṁ lmaḥ An· sinīma, śīmā paṅurumbigyana rakryān· kabayān·, parṇnahanya svatantrā, tan· katamāna deniṁ patiḥ vahuta rāma, muAṁ saprakāraniṁ maṅilala dr̥<span tip="Hyphen break" lang="zxx latin">-</span></line><line lang="kaw kawi"><nline break="false" phantom="false" significant="true"><span tip="Line start" lang="zxx latin">⟨1r9⟩</span><!--space--> </nline><ncell break="false" phantom="true" significant="true"/>bya haji riṁ daṅū, miśra parāmiśra vulu-vulu prakāra, paṅu<span class="space" tip="Space left blank in a line because (part of) another character hanging down from the previous line encroaches on the current line" lang="kaw kawi">⊔</span>raṁ, kriṁ, paḍam·, manimpiki, paraṇa<span class="space" tip="Space left blank in a line because (part of) another character hanging down from the previous line encroaches on the current line" lang="kaw kawi">⊔</span>kan·, limus gal<span class="sic" tip="Incorrect text (emendation: &lt;span class=&quot;corr&quot;&gt;⟨u⟩&lt;/span&gt;)" lang="kaw kawi"><display lang="study_other latin">¿</display>a<display lang="study_other latin">?</display></span>ḥ, paṅaruhan·, taji, vatu tajam·<span class="unclear" tip="Unclear text" lang="kaw kawi">(,)</span><!--space--> sukun·, halu varak·, ra<span tip="Hyphen break" lang="zxx latin">-</span></line><line lang="kaw kawi"><nline break="false" phantom="false" significant="true"><span tip="Line start" lang="zxx latin">⟨1r10⟩</span><!--space--> </nline><ncell break="false" phantom="true" significant="true"/>ka